  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nGiven:\n\n(19, 39, 44)\n\n⇒ 19 × 2 + 1 → 38 + 1 = 39\n\n⇒ 39 + 5 = 44\n\nAnd,\n\n(13, 27, 32)\n\n⇒ 13 × 2 + 1 = 26 + 1 = 27\n\n⇒ 27 + 5 = 32\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) (24, 45, 50)\n\n⇒ 24 × 2 + 1 → 48 + 1 = 49 ≠ 45\n\n⇒ 45 + 5 = 50\n\nOption 2) (35, 61, 66)\n\n⇒ 35 × 2 + 1 → 70 + 1 = 71 ≠ 61\n\n⇒ 61 + 5 = 66\n\nOption 3) (29, 49, 54)\n\n⇒ 29 × 2 + 1 → 58 + 1 = 59 ≠ 49\n\n⇒ 49 + 5 = 54\n\nOption 4) (11, 23, 28)\n\n⇒ 11 × 2 + 1 → 22 + 1 = 23\n\n⇒ 23 + 5 = 28\n\nThus, out of all '(11, 23, 28)' follows the same logic.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**.",
